WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.168
Watch and read: For your roleplay practice, what greeting fits sunrise?

00:00:05.033 --> 00:00:09.065
The answer is: Good morning. Good morning is used at that time of day.

00:00:09.867 --> 00:00:13.877
Watch and read: For your greetings practice, what greeting fits sunrise?

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:18.732
The answer is: Good morning. Good morning is used at that time of day.
